# Marketplace Icon

Create a **128 × 128 px** PNG.

Design suggestion:

* Dark navy background
* Gold quill
* Open book
* Small constellation or star motif
* Simple enough to remain recognizable at small sizes

---

# Snippet Organization

Instead of a single large file, split snippets by purpose:

```text
snippets/

ai.code-snippets
manuscript.code-snippets
characters.code-snippets
worldbuilding.code-snippets
lore.code-snippets
planning.code-snippets
publishing.code-snippets
```

This keeps maintenance manageable.

---

# Publish Workflow

Once you're ready:

```bash
npm install -g @vscode/vsce
```

Package the extension:

```bash
vsce package
```

This creates a `.vsix` file for local testing.

When satisfied:

```bash
vsce publish
```

